Hi Sarah,

I've attached a PDF showing one approach to this.  I am also attached the R markdown file (.rmd) used to generate the PDF, which has the raw R codes.

You'll need a recent version of the MplusAutomation package, possibly the development one from github (I don't think you do, but I don't quite remember what all features made it into the last version of MplusAutomation on CRAN).

Best wishes,

Josh

